ECHO

OPERATE
--  correlate PERMX to PORO using PERMX = 10^(-0.02 + PORO*10.)
--
--  result  box operation   operand
--  array       10^(a+bX)   array   a       b
    PERMX   6*  SLOG        PORO    -.02    10. /

--  equal PERMY to PERMX
--  result  box operation   operand
--  array       aX+b        array   a   b
    PERMY   6*  MULTA       PERMX   1.  0.  /

--  set PERMZ to 0.1 of PERMX
--  result  box operation   operand
--  array       aX+b        array   a   b
    PERMZ   6*  MULTA       PERMX   .1  0.  /
/



